-- The 44 doctors Respublika Diaqnostika Merkezi publishes.
--
-- Read from rdm.az on 2026-09-19, in Azerbaijani. The eighth source.
--
-- The count is 44 and two readings agree exactly, with nothing on either side
-- the other lacks: the directory paginates four pages of 12, 12, 12 and 8, and
-- the site's own sitemap carries 44 doctor URLs. This is the first source
-- whose sitemap could simply be trusted.
--
-- None of these doctors asked to be here. Every row is UNCLAIMED with
-- accepts_bookings = 0.
--
-- One name already existed in this directory twice over. There is a Kenan
-- Ahmadov at Merkezi Klinika who is a cardiologist and qualified in 1997-2003,
-- and another who is a dermatologist; this one is a urologist and head of
-- department who qualified at the Pirogov university in Moscow in 2005-2011.
-- Three different men, one common name, so this one's slug is suffixed or
-- INSERT IGNORE would have dropped him without a word.
--
-- This source states length of service itself for 43 of the 44, so
-- years_experience is the centre's own figure rather than one worked out from
-- a graduation year. The one it leaves out, Elxan Zergerov, falls back to
-- years since his degree ended in 2008, which is how every source that
-- publishes no figure at all is handled.
--
-- Every doctor publishes their education and their career, and every one has a
-- portrait. What is deliberately not imported is the patient reviews: each
-- profile carries a star rating and named comments, and republishing somebody
-- else's reviews under our name would be passing off their word as ours.
-- Where a doctor's academic degree is simply "Hekim" it adds nothing to the
-- biography and is left out; a doctorate or professorship is kept.
--
-- Data only.

INSERT INTO clinic (name, slug, address, city, phone, description, active, created_at, updated_at)
SELECT * FROM (SELECT
    'Respublika Diaqnostika Mərkəzi' AS name, 'respublika-diaqnostika-merkezi' AS slug,
    'Tbilisi prospekti 147, 20 Yanvar, Bakı' AS address, 'Bakı' AS city,
    '*913' AS phone,
    'Respublika Diaqnostika Mərkəzi, Bakı. Siyahı mərkəzin rdm.az saytındakı həkim kataloqu əsasında hazırlanıb.' AS description,
    1 AS active, NOW() AS created_at, NOW() AS updated_at) AS c
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM clinic WHERE slug = 'respublika-diaqnostika-merkezi');

